                        Halaman 2
                      </span>
                      <h3 className="text-sm font-black font-sans leading-tight text-center mt-1 uppercase">
                        BAB I: PENDAHULUAN & KOMPETENSI INTI
                      </h3>
                      <h4 className="text-xs font-bold font-sans mt-3">A. Deskripsi Materi Pembelajaran</h4>
                      <p className="text-xs leading-loose font-semibold opacity-90">
                        Pada bab ini, kita akan mempelajari konsep-konsep dasar, pemetaan kompetensi, dan instrumen latihan mandiri untuk memperkuat daya analisis. Pembelajaran mandiri menuntut fokus, kedisiplinan, serta kemampuan memecahkan masalah menggunakan kerangka teoritis yang diajarkan dalam modul ini.
                      </p>
                      <h4 className="text-xs font-bold font-sans mt-3">B. Kompetensi Dasar (KD)</h4>
                      <p className="text-xs leading-loose font-semibold opacity-90">
                        1.1 Mengidentifikasi karakteristik struktural materi dan kaitannya dengan fenomena lingkungan sekitar.<br/>
                        1.2 Menerapkan prinsip analisis kualitatif dalam menyusun kesimpulan logis dan ilmiah.
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  )}

                  {currentPage === 3 && (
                    <div className="space-y-4 py-4 text-justify">
                      <span className="text-[10px] uppercase font-black text-emerald-600 tracking-widest block font-sans text-center">
                        Halaman 3
                      </span>
                      <h3 className="text-sm font-black font-sans leading-tight text-center mt-1 uppercase">
                        BAB II: EVALUASI & LATIHAN MANDIRI
                      </h3>
                      <p className="text-xs leading-loose font-semibold opacity-90">
                        Silakan jawab pertanyaan-pertanyaan berikut berdasarkan pembahasan materi di halaman sebelumnya untuk menguji pemahaman Anda:
                      </p>
                      <div className="bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-xl p-3 space-y-2 font-sans text-xs">
                        <p className="font-bold text-emerald-800">Soal Latihan:</p>
                        <ol className="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1 font-semibold text-slate-700">
                          <li>Jelaskan apa saja komponen utama dalam menyusun kesimpulan ilmiah secara objektif!</li>
                          <li>Bagaimanakah penerapan pola berpikir kritis membantu Anda memahami materi ajar kesetaraan ini?</li>
                        </ol>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  )}
                </div>

                {/* Reader Pagination */}
                <div className="flex items-center justify-between w-full max-w-xl mt-6 text-xs font-black">
                  <button
                    disabled={currentPage === 1}
                    onClick={() => setCurrentPage(p => Math.max(1, p - 1))}
                    className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-1 transition-all cursor-pointer ${
                      currentPage === 1 
                        ? 'opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed' 
                        : libraryViewerDarkMode 
                        ? 'bg-slate-800 text-white hover:bg-slate-750' 
                        : 'bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50'
                    }`}
                  >
                    Sebelumnya
                  </button>
                  <span className="opacity-80">Halaman {currentPage} dari 3</span>
                  <button
                    disabled={currentPage === 3}
                    onClick={() => setCurrentPage(p => Math.min(3, p + 1))}
                    className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-xl flex items-center gap-1 transition-all cursor-pointer ${
                      currentPage === 3 
                        ? 'opacity-40 cursor-not-allowed' 
                        : libraryViewerDarkMode 
                        ? 'bg-slate-800 text-white hover:bg-slate-750' 
                        : 'bg-white border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50'
                    }`}
                  >
                    Selanjutnya
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          ) : null}
        </div>
      )}

      {/* SERTIFIKAT SCREEN */}
      {activeTab === 'sertifikat' && (
        <DokumenAkademik 
          role="siswa"
          students={students || []}
          loggedInUser={{
            id: studentObj.id || 'SIS-1001',
            nama: studentObj.nama || username || 'Siswa',
            nisn: studentObj.nisn || '0098765432',
              studentId: studentObj.id || 'SIS-1001',
            role: 'siswa'
          }}
          showModal={showModal}
        />
      )}

      {/* MADING SCREEN */}
      {activeTab === 'pengumuman' && (
        <div className="flex-1 flex flex-col bg-slate-50 overflow-hidden">
          <div className="px-5 pt-4 pb-3 bg-white border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center justify-between shrink-0">
            <h2 className="text-base font-extrabold text-slate-800">Mading Sekolah</h2>
          </div>
          <div className="flex-1 p-4 space-y-3 overflow-y-auto no-scrollbar">
            {madingLoading && (
              <div className="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 text-center">
                <p className="text-xs font-bold text-slate-500">
                  Memuat Mading sekolah...
                </p>
              </div>
            )}

            {!madingLoading && madingError && (
              <div className="rounded-2xl border border-rose-200 bg-rose-50 p-4">
                <p className="text-xs font-bold text-rose-700">
                  {madingError}
                </p>
              </div>
            )}

            {!madingLoading && !madingError && madingItems.length === 0 && (
              <div className="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-white p-6 text-center">
                <p className="text-xs font-bold text-slate-600">
                  Belum ada pengumuman.
                </p>
              </div>
            )}

            {madingItems.map((item) => (
              <div key={item.id} className="bg-white p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 shadow-sm space-y-2">
                <span className="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-red-100 text-red-600 border border-red-200 text-[8px] font-extrabold uppercase">
                  {item.category}
                </span>
                <h4 className="text-xs font-bold text-slate-850 mt-1">{item.title}</h4>
                <p className="text-[9px] text-slate-500 mt-1 leading-relaxed font-semibold">{item.desc}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      )}

      {/* Sticky Bottom Navigation Bar */}
      <div className="h-16 border-t border-slate-100 bg-white flex items-center justify-around select-none sticky bottom-0 z-20 shrink-0 shadow-[0_-4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]">
        <div 
          onClick={() => { setSelectedSubject(null); setActiveTab('beranda'); }} 
          className={`flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 cursor-pointer transition-colors ${
            activeTab === 'beranda' ? 'text-pink-600' : 'text-slate-400 hover:text-pink-600'
          }`}
        >
          <Home className="w-4 h-4" />
          <span className="text-[8px] font-black">Beranda</span>
        </div>
        <div 
          onClick={() => { setSelectedSubject(null); setActiveTab('materi'); }} 
          className={`flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 cursor-pointer transition-colors ${
            activeTab === 'materi' ? 'text-pink-600' : 'text-slate-400 hover:text-pink-600'
          }`}
        >
          <BookOpen className="w-4 h-4" />
          <span className="text-[8px] font-bold">Materi</span>
        </div>
        <div 
          onClick={() => setActiveTab('tugas')} 
          className={`flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 cursor-pointer transition-colors ${
            activeTab === 'tugas' ? 'text-pink-600' : 'text-slate-400 hover:text-pink-600'
          }`}
        >
          <FileText className="w-4 h-4" />
          <span className="text-[8px] font-bold">Tugas</span>
        </div>
        <div 
          onClick={() => setActiveTab('tagihan')} 
          className={`flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 cursor-pointer transition-colors ${
            activeTab === 'tagihan' ? 'text-pink-600' : 'text-slate-400 hover:text-pink-600'
          }`}
        >
          <Wallet className="w-4 h-4" />
          <span className="text-[8px] font-bold">Tagihan</span>
        </div>
        <div 
          onClick={() => setActiveTab('profil')} 
          className={`flex flex-col items-center gap-0.5 cursor-pointer transition-colors ${
            activeTab === 'profil' ? 'text-pink-600' : 'text-slate-400 hover:text-pink-600'
          }`}
        >
          <User className="w-4 h-4" />
          <span className="text-[8px] font-bold">Profil</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  );
}
